PROGRAM – 5

TITLE: Introduction to Jenkins – Installation and Configuration

AIM:
To install and configure Jenkins for Continuous Integration.

PROCEDURE:

1. Download Jenkins from the official website.

2. Run the Jenkins MSI Installer.

3. Select "Run service as Local System".

4. Choose port number 8080 and continue installation.

5. Verify Java installation using:

   java -version

6. Complete the Jenkins installation and click Finish.

7. Open Jenkins in a browser:

   http://localhost:8080

8. Obtain the Administrator Password from:

   C:\ProgramData\Jenkins.jenkins\secrets\initialAdminPassword

9. Paste the password and continue.

10. Select "Install Suggested Plugins".

11. Skip registration or create an admin user.

12. Open Jenkins Dashboard.

